enn9le15ob05re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Conspiracy theory! Speculate on the reasons behind the death or disappearance of a well-known celebrity by creating a list of theories. "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0, "_data": []}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le15ob05re2img01.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le15ob05re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le15ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le15ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<p>Could Mozart really have been murdered? Might poison have been the cause of his death? For centuries, these questions have been pondered by biographers and historians. They are difficult to answer, especially since new information regarding his life is constantly being uncovered.</p> Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart was born in Salzburg, Austria, in 1756. Even when he was very young, everyone could see that he was a musical genius. His father, a musician and composer, took his five-year-old prodigy on a tour of Europe to play in concerts. Wolfgang amazed kings, queens, and their courts with his musical ingenuity.", "id": 1}, {"time": "47000", "image": "engenn9le15ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "As an adult, however, Mozart never earned enough to pay for his luxurious lifestyle. While he was being venerated by critics and the public for his musical acumen, Mozart's financial situation was becoming worse and worse. In 1791, at the age of thirty-five, the great virtuoso died as a poor man without even enough money to put a name on the gravestone.", "id": 2}, {"time": "75500", "image": "engenn9le15ob05re2img03.jpg", "text": "<p>Ever since, it has been speculated that his death may not have been entirely natural. Some have suggested that he may have been poisoned by a jealous counterpart, or that he could have been murdered by angry debt collectors. </p>The idea that Mozart might have been murdered is not new. It has been explored in print, by the great Pushkin, and in film, by Milos Forman. It is interesting to think that while his music is being enjoyed by millions around the world, his death is being contemplated by an inquisitive few.", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}